{"seq":1,"slug":"gradle-fundamentals","title":"Gradle 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/build-and-release/gradle-fundamentals","wordCount":521,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"gradle-基础\">Gradle 基础</h1><p>Gradle 是 Android 项目的构建系统，负责编译代码、管理依赖、生成 APK/AAB。现代 Android 项目使用 Kotlin DSL（<code>build.gradle.kts</code>）编写构建脚本，结合 Version Catalog 统一管理依赖版本。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Gradle 构建围绕四个核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>双层脚本结构</strong>：根级 <code>build.gradle.kts</code> 声明插件（<code>apply false</code>），模块级脚本应用插件并配置 <code>android { }</code>；<code>settings.gradle.kts</code> 是项目结构入口。</li>\n<li><strong>依赖配置（Configuration）</strong>：<code>implementation</code> 不传递给消费者、<code>api</code> 会传递、<code>compileOnly</code> / <code>runtimeOnly</code> 控制可见性；优先 <code>implementation</code> 以加快增量编译。</li>\n<li><strong>Version Catalog</strong>：<code>libs.versions.toml</code> 集中声明版本、库与插件，消除多模块版本不一致。</li>\n<li><strong>Convention Plugins</strong>：把多模块共享的构建逻辑抽到 <code>build-logic</code> included build 中，避免配置重复。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"build-gradle-kts\">build.gradle.kts</h2><p>Android 项目通常有根级别和模块级别两个构建脚本。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 根级 build.gradle.kts&#10;plugins {&#10;    alias(libs.plugins.android.application) apply false&#10;    alias(libs.plugins.android.library) apply false&#10;    alias(libs.plugins.kotlin.android) apply false&#10;    alias(libs.plugins.kotlin.compose) apply false&#10;    alias(libs.plugins.hilt.android) apply false&#10;    alias(libs.plugins.ksp) apply false&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 模块级 app/build.gradle.kts&#10;plugins {&#10;    alias(libs.plugins.android.application)&#10;    alias(libs.plugins.kotlin.android)&#10;    alias(libs.plugins.kotlin.compose)&#10;    alias(libs.plugins.hilt.android)&#10;    alias(libs.plugins.ksp)&#10;}&#10;&#10;android {&#10;    namespace = &quot;com.example.myapp&quot;&#10;    compileSdk = 35&#10;&#10;    defaultConfig {&#10;        applicationId = &quot;com.example.myapp&quot;&#10;        minSdk = 26&#10;        targetSdk = 35&#10;        versionCode = 1&#10;        versionName = &quot;1.0.0&quot;&#10;        testInstrumentationRunner = &quot;com.example.myapp.HiltTestRunner&quot;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    buildFeatures {&#10;        compose = true&#10;        buildConfig = true&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    compileOptions {&#10;        sourceCompatibility = JavaVersion.VERSION_17&#10;        targetCompatibility = JavaVersion.VERSION_17&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    kotlinOptions {&#10;        jvmTarget = &quot;17&quot;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 根级 build.gradle.kts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>plugins {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    alias(libs.plugins.android.application) apply false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    alias(libs.plugins.android.library) apply false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    alias(libs.plugins.kotlin.android) apply false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    alias(libs.plugins.kotlin.compose) apply false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    alias(libs.plugins.hilt.android) apply false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    alias(libs.plugins.ksp) apply false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 模块级 app/build.gradle.kts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>plugins {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    alias(libs.plugins.android.application)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    alias(libs.plugins.kotlin.android)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    alias(libs.plugins.kotlin.compose)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    alias(libs.plugins.hilt.android)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    alias(libs.plugins.ksp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>android {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    namespace = \"com.example.myapp\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    compileSdk = 35</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    defaultConfig {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        applicationId = \"com.example.myapp\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        minSdk = 26</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        targetSdk = 35</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        versionCode = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        versionName = \"1.0.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        testInstrumentationRunner = \"com.example.myapp.HiltTestRunner\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    buildFeatures {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        compose = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        buildConfig = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    compileOptions {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        sourceCompatibility = JavaVersion.VERSION_17</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        targetCompatibility = JavaVersion.VERSION_17</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    kotlinOptions {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        jvmTarget = \"17\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[settings.gradle.kts] --&gt; B[根 build.gradle.kts]&#10;    B --&gt; C[app/build.gradle.kts]&#10;    B --&gt; D[feature/home/build.gradle.kts]&#10;    B --&gt; E[core/data/build.gradle.kts]&#10;    F[gradle/libs.versions.toml] --&gt; C&#10;    F --&gt; D&#10;    F --&gt; E&#10;&#10;    classDef rootStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    classDef moduleStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class B rootStyle&#10;    class C,D,E moduleStyle\">graph TD\n    A[settings.gradle.kts] --&gt; B[根 build.gradle.kts]\n    B --&gt; C[app/build.gradle.kts]\n    B --&gt; D[feature/home/build.gradle.kts]\n    B --&gt; E[core/data/build.gradle.kts]\n    F[gradle/libs.versions.toml] --&gt; C\n    F --&gt; D\n    F --&gt; E\n\n    classDef rootStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    classDef moduleStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class B rootStyle\n    class C,D,E moduleStyle</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"插件\">插件</h2><p>Gradle 插件为构建过程添加功能，Android 项目常用的插件包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>插件</th>\n<th>ID</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Android Application</td>\n<td><code>com.android.application</code></td>\n<td>构建 Android 应用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Android Library</td>\n<td><code>com.android.library</code></td>\n<td>构建 Android 库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kotlin Android</td>\n<td><code>org.jetbrains.kotlin.android</code></td>\n<td>Kotlin 编译支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kotlin Compose</td>\n<td><code>org.jetbrains.kotlin.plugin.compose</code></td>\n<td>Compose 编译器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hilt</td>\n<td><code>com.google.dagger.hilt.android</code></td>\n<td>Hilt 代码生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KSP</td>\n<td><code>com.google.devtools.ksp</code></td>\n<td>Kotlin 符号处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kotlin Serialization</td>\n<td><code>org.jetbrains.kotlin.plugin.serialization</code></td>\n<td>序列化支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// settings.gradle.kts 中声明插件仓库&#10;pluginManagement {&#10;    repositories {&#10;        google {&#10;            content {&#10;                includeGroupByRegex(&quot;com\\\\.android.*&quot;)&#10;                includeGroupByRegex(&quot;com\\\\.google.*&quot;)&#10;                includeGroupByRegex(&quot;androidx.*&quot;)&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;        mavenCentral()&#10;        gradlePluginPortal()&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;dependencyResolutionManagement {&#10;    repositoriesMode.set(RepositoriesMode.FAIL_ON_PROJECT_REPOS)&#10;    repositories {&#10;        google()&#10;        mavenCentral()&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;rootProject.name = &quot;MyApp&quot;&#10;include(&quot;:app&quot;)&#10;include(&quot;:core:data&quot;)&#10;include(&quot;:core:domain&quot;)&#10;include(&quot;:core:ui&quot;)&#10;include(&quot;:feature:home&quot;)&#10;include(&quot;:feature:settings&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// settings.gradle.kts 中声明插件仓库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pluginManagement {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    repositories {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        google {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            content {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                includeGroupByRegex(\"com\\\\.android.*\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                includeGroupByRegex(\"com\\\\.google.*\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                includeGroupByRegex(\"androidx.*\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        mavenCentral()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        gradlePluginPortal()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dependencyResolutionManagement {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    repositoriesMode.set(RepositoriesMode.FAIL_ON_PROJECT_REPOS)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    repositories {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        google()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        mavenCentral()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>rootProject.name = \"MyApp\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>include(\":app\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>include(\":core:data\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>include(\":core:domain\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>include(\":core:ui\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>include(\":feature:home\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>include(\":feature:settings\")</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"依赖管理\">依赖管理</h2><p>依赖声明使用 <code>implementation</code>、<code>api</code>、<code>compileOnly</code> 等配置。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"dependencies {&#10;    implementation(libs.androidx.core.ktx)&#10;    implementation(libs.androidx.lifecycle.runtime.ktx)&#10;    implementation(libs.androidx.activity.compose)&#10;&#10;    implementation(platform(libs.androidx.compose.bom))&#10;    implementation(libs.androidx.compose.ui)&#10;    implementation(libs.androidx.compose.material3)&#10;    implementation(libs.androidx.compose.ui.tooling.preview)&#10;    debugImplementation(libs.androidx.compose.ui.tooling)&#10;&#10;    implementation(libs.hilt.android)&#10;    ksp(libs.hilt.compiler)&#10;&#10;    implementation(libs.retrofit)&#10;    implementation(libs.okhttp.logging)&#10;&#10;    testImplementation(libs.junit)&#10;    testImplementation(libs.mockk)&#10;    testImplementation(libs.turbine)&#10;    testImplementation(libs.kotlinx.coroutines.test)&#10;&#10;    androidTestImplementation(libs.androidx.test.ext)&#10;    androidTestImplementation(libs.hilt.android.testing)&#10;    kspAndroidTest(libs.hilt.compiler)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>dependencies {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    implementation(libs.androidx.core.ktx)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    implementation(libs.androidx.lifecycle.runtime.ktx)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    implementation(libs.androidx.activity.compose)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    implementation(platform(libs.androidx.compose.bom))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    implementation(libs.androidx.compose.ui)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    implementation(libs.androidx.compose.material3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    implementation(libs.androidx.compose.ui.tooling.preview)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    debugImplementation(libs.androidx.compose.ui.tooling)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    implementation(libs.hilt.android)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ksp(libs.hilt.compiler)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    implementation(libs.retrofit)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    implementation(libs.okhttp.logging)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    testImplementation(libs.junit)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    testImplementation(libs.mockk)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    testImplementation(libs.turbine)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    testImplementation(libs.kotlinx.coroutines.test)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    androidTestImplementation(libs.androidx.test.ext)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    androidTestImplementation(libs.hilt.android.testing)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    kspAndroidTest(libs.hilt.compiler)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>依赖配置对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置</th>\n<th>编译可见</th>\n<th>运行时可见</th>\n<th>传递给消费者</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>implementation</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>api</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>compileOnly</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>runtimeOnly</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>testImplementation</code></td>\n<td>测试编译</td>\n<td>测试运行</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>androidTestImplementation</code></td>\n<td>仪器测试</td>\n<td>仪器测试</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 优先使用 <code>implementation</code> 而非 <code>api</code>，减少编译时依赖传递，加快增量编译速度。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"version-catalog\">Version Catalog</h2><p>Version Catalog（<code>libs.versions.toml</code>）集中管理所有依赖版本。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"[versions]&#10;agp = &quot;8.7.0&quot;&#10;kotlin = &quot;2.0.21&quot;&#10;compose-bom = &quot;2024.11.00&quot;&#10;hilt = &quot;2.52&quot;&#10;room = &quot;2.6.1&quot;&#10;retrofit = &quot;2.11.0&quot;&#10;okhttp = &quot;4.12.0&quot;&#10;coroutines = &quot;1.9.0&quot;&#10;ksp = &quot;2.0.21-1.0.27&quot;&#10;&#10;[libraries]&#10;androidx-core-ktx = { group = &quot;androidx.core&quot;, name = &quot;core-ktx&quot;, version = &quot;1.15.0&quot; }&#10;androidx-lifecycle-runtime-ktx = { group = &quot;androidx.lifecycle&quot;, name = &quot;lifecycle-runtime-ktx&quot;, version = &quot;2.8.7&quot; }&#10;androidx-activity-compose = { group = &quot;androidx.activity&quot;, name = &quot;activity-compose&quot;, version = &quot;1.9.3&quot; }&#10;&#10;androidx-compose-bom = { group = &quot;androidx.compose&quot;, name = &quot;compose-bom&quot;, version.ref = &quot;compose-bom&quot; }&#10;androidx-compose-ui = { group = &quot;androidx.compose.ui&quot;, name = &quot;ui&quot; }&#10;androidx-compose-material3 = { group = &quot;androidx.compose.material3&quot;, name = &quot;material3&quot; }&#10;&#10;hilt-android = { group = &quot;com.google.dagger&quot;, name = &quot;hilt-android&quot;, version.ref = &quot;hilt&quot; }&#10;hilt-compiler = { group = &quot;com.google.dagger&quot;, name = &quot;hilt-compiler&quot;, version.ref = &quot;hilt&quot; }&#10;&#10;retrofit = { group = &quot;com.squareup.retrofit2&quot;, name = &quot;retrofit&quot;, version.ref = &quot;retrofit&quot; }&#10;okhttp-logging = { group = &quot;com.squareup.okhttp3&quot;, name = &quot;logging-interceptor&quot;, version.ref = &quot;okhttp&quot; }&#10;&#10;room-runtime = { group = &quot;androidx.room&quot;, name = &quot;room-runtime&quot;, version.ref = &quot;room&quot; }&#10;room-ktx = { group = &quot;androidx.room&quot;, name = &quot;room-ktx&quot;, version.ref = &quot;room&quot; }&#10;room-compiler = { group = &quot;androidx.room&quot;, name = &quot;room-compiler&quot;, version.ref = &quot;room&quot; }&#10;&#10;[plugins]&#10;android-application = { id = &quot;com.android.application&quot;, version.ref = &quot;agp&quot; }&#10;android-library = { id = &quot;com.android.library&quot;, version.ref = &quot;agp&quot; }&#10;kotlin-android = { id = &quot;org.jetbrains.kotlin.android&quot;, version.ref = &quot;kotlin&quot; }&#10;kotlin-compose = { id = &quot;org.jetbrains.kotlin.plugin.compose&quot;, version.ref = &quot;kotlin&quot; }&#10;hilt-android = { id = &quot;com.google.dagger.hilt.android&quot;, version.ref = &quot;hilt&quot; }&#10;ksp = { id = &quot;com.google.devtools.ksp&quot;, version.ref = &quot;ksp&quot; }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[versions]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>agp = \"8.7.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>kotlin = \"2.0.21\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>compose-bom = \"2024.11.00\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>hilt = \"2.52\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>room = \"2.6.1\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>retrofit = \"2.11.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>okhttp = \"4.12.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>coroutines = \"1.9.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ksp = \"2.0.21-1.0.27\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[libraries]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>androidx-core-ktx = { group = \"androidx.core\", name = \"core-ktx\", version = \"1.15.0\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>androidx-lifecycle-runtime-ktx = { group = \"androidx.lifecycle\", name = \"lifecycle-runtime-ktx\", version = \"2.8.7\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>androidx-activity-compose = { group = \"androidx.activity\", name = \"activity-compose\", version = \"1.9.3\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>androidx-compose-bom = { group = \"androidx.compose\", name = \"compose-bom\", version.ref = \"compose-bom\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>androidx-compose-ui = { group = \"androidx.compose.ui\", name = \"ui\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>androidx-compose-material3 = { group = \"androidx.compose.material3\", name = \"material3\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>hilt-android = { group = \"com.google.dagger\", name = \"hilt-android\", version.ref = \"hilt\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>hilt-compiler = { group = \"com.google.dagger\", name = \"hilt-compiler\", version.ref = \"hilt\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>retrofit = { group = \"com.squareup.retrofit2\", name = \"retrofit\", version.ref = \"retrofit\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>okhttp-logging = { group = \"com.squareup.okhttp3\", name = \"logging-interceptor\", version.ref = \"okhttp\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>room-runtime = { group = \"androidx.room\", name = \"room-runtime\", version.ref = \"room\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>room-ktx = { group = \"androidx.room\", name = \"room-ktx\", version.ref = \"room\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>room-compiler = { group = \"androidx.room\", name = \"room-compiler\", version.ref = \"room\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[plugins]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>android-application = { id = \"com.android.application\", version.ref = \"agp\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>android-library = { id = \"com.android.library\", version.ref = \"agp\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>kotlin-android = { id = \"org.jetbrains.kotlin.android\", version.ref = \"kotlin\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>kotlin-compose = { id = \"org.jetbrains.kotlin.plugin.compose\", version.ref = \"kotlin\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>hilt-android = { id = \"com.google.dagger.hilt.android\", version.ref = \"hilt\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ksp = { id = \"com.google.devtools.ksp\", version.ref = \"ksp\" }</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"convention-plugins\">Convention Plugins</h2><p>Convention Plugins 抽取共享的构建逻辑，避免多模块间的配置重复。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// build-logic/convention/build.gradle.kts&#10;plugins {&#10;    `kotlin-dsl`&#10;}&#10;&#10;dependencies {&#10;    compileOnly(libs.android.gradlePlugin)&#10;    compileOnly(libs.kotlin.gradlePlugin)&#10;    compileOnly(libs.compose.gradlePlugin)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// build-logic/convention/src/main/kotlin/AndroidLibraryConventionPlugin.kt&#10;class AndroidLibraryConventionPlugin : Plugin&lt;Project&gt; {&#10;    override fun apply(target: Project) {&#10;        with(target) {&#10;            pluginManager.apply(&quot;com.android.library&quot;)&#10;            pluginManager.apply(&quot;org.jetbrains.kotlin.android&quot;)&#10;&#10;            extensions.configure&lt;LibraryExtension&gt; {&#10;                compileSdk = 35&#10;                defaultConfig.minSdk = 26&#10;                compileOptions {&#10;                    sourceCompatibility = JavaVersion.VERSION_17&#10;                    targetCompatibility = JavaVersion.VERSION_17&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;&#10;            extensions.configure&lt;KotlinAndroidProjectExtension&gt; {&#10;                jvmToolchain(17)&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// build-logic/convention/build.gradle.kts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>plugins {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    `kotlin-dsl`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dependencies {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    compileOnly(libs.android.gradlePlugin)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    compileOnly(libs.kotlin.gradlePlugin)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    compileOnly(libs.compose.gradlePlugin)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// build-logic/convention/src/main/kotlin/AndroidLibraryConventionPlugin.kt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class AndroidLibraryConventionPlugin : Plugin&#x3C;Project> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun apply(target: Project) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        with(target) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            pluginManager.apply(\"com.android.library\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            pluginManager.apply(\"org.jetbrains.kotlin.android\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            extensions.configure&#x3C;LibraryExtension> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                compileSdk = 35</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                defaultConfig.minSdk = 26</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                compileOptions {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    sourceCompatibility = JavaVersion.VERSION_17</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    targetCompatibility = JavaVersion.VERSION_17</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            extensions.configure&#x3C;KotlinAndroidProjectExtension> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                jvmToolchain(17)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Convention Plugin] --&gt; B[&quot;:core:data&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;:core:domain&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;:feature:home&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;:feature:settings&quot;]&#10;&#10;    A --- F[&quot;统一 compileSdk、minSdk、JVM 版本&quot;]&#10;&#10;    classDef pluginStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class A pluginStyle\">graph TD\n    A[Convention Plugin] --&gt; B[\":core:data\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\":core:domain\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\":feature:home\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\":feature:settings\"]\n\n    A --- F[\"统一 compileSdk、minSdk、JVM 版本\"]\n\n    classDef pluginStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class A pluginStyle</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Convention Plugins 放在 <code>build-logic</code> 目录下，作为 included build 使用，这是 Now in Android 等官方示例推荐的模式。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>build.gradle.kts</code> 使用 Kotlin DSL 定义构建配置，分为根级和模块级</li>\n<li>Version Catalog（<code>libs.versions.toml</code>）集中管理依赖版本，消除版本不一致</li>\n<li>优先使用 <code>implementation</code> 配置减少依赖传递，加快编译速度</li>\n<li>Convention Plugins 抽取多模块共享的构建逻辑，避免配置重复</li>\n<li><code>settings.gradle.kts</code> 声明模块和仓库，是项目结构的入口</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Gradle 基础","id":"gradle-基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"build.gradle.kts","id":"build-gradle-kts"},{"level":2,"text":"插件","id":"插件"},{"level":2,"text":"依赖管理","id":"依赖管理"},{"level":2,"text":"Version Catalog","id":"version-catalog"},{"level":2,"text":"Convention Plugins","id":"convention-plugins"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"图片加载","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/networking-and-data/image-loading"},"next":{"title":"构建变体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/build-and-release/build-variants"}}